1
00:00:00,989 --> 00:00:03,800
易考范文三十五

2
00:00:03,809 --> 00:00:08,240
With the development of society,

3
00:00:08,249 --> 00:00:11,160
people have to face all aspects of pressure

4
00:00:11,169 --> 00:00:13,520
that comes from family and society,

5
00:00:13,529 --> 00:00:16,070
from study and work. Therefore,

6
00:00:16,079 --> 00:00:19,160
keeping a good mood becomes more and more important,

7
00:00:19,169 --> 00:00:21,920
no matter what situation we are in.

8
00:00:21,929 --> 00:00:24,290
In the first place,

9
00:00:24,299 --> 00:00:27,010
a good mood enables you to keep healthy.

10
00:00:27,019 --> 00:00:30,600
A good mood helps us to be optimistic towards everything,

11
00:00:30,609 --> 00:00:34,300
and therefore reduces the possibility of getting ill.

12
00:00:34,309 --> 00:00:36,660
At the same time it increases

13
00:00:36,669 --> 00:00:39,270
the possibility of recovering from illness.

14
00:00:39,279 --> 00:00:42,860
In the second place, a good mood enables us

15
00:00:42,869 --> 00:00:44,910
to study or work efficiently.

16
00:00:44,919 --> 00:00:47,870
Stress is a natural part of daily life

17
00:00:47,879 --> 00:00:50,340
and there is no way to avoid it,

18
00:00:50,349 --> 00:00:53,840
but a good mood helps develop our adaptive abilities

19
00:00:53,849 --> 00:00:56,970
to deal well with it rather than escape from it.

20
00:00:56,979 --> 00:00:59,230
Based on the above reasons,

21
00:00:59,239 --> 00:01:02,120
we can safely come to the conclusion that

22
00:01:02,129 --> 00:01:05,280
 it is important to keep a good mood in our daily life.

23
00:01:05,289 --> 00:01:07,670
It can benefit both our health

24
00:01:07,679 --> 00:01:10,120
and our efficiency of work and study.

25
00:01:10,129 --> 00:01:12,430
If you are not keeping a good mood,

26
00:01:12,439 --> 00:01:14,430
just start to improve now.

